Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:35.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《永远的蝙蝠侠》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以劝你带上三明治吗 先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I persuade you to take a sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.39,0:01:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己去买\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get drive-through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在希望那个长翅膀的复仇者救你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're counting on the winged avenger to deliver you from evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 我的朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}aren't you, my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀死我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许 也许不 因为这件世上我们总有两种意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, maybe not. We're of two minds on the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.18,0:02:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,要赌博吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a gambling man?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们扔硬币决定吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What say we flip for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.06,0:03:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的人天生彪悍骁勇 而他的弟弟可能是胆小如鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}One man is born a hero, his brother a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱门酒肉臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babies starve, politicians grow fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,路有冻死骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}holy men are martyred, and junkies grow legion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.13,0:03:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？为什么？为什么？为什么？为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, why, why, why, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.21,0:03:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.91,0:03:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,盲目的 愚蠢的 简单的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blind, stupid, simple, doo-dah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.74,0:03:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无规律的运气！\N{\fnArial\fs30}clueless luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,随手一扔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The random toss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的公正\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the only true justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.72,0:03:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们来看看什么样的运气在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what justice has in store.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.73,0:03:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.23,0:03:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就象上帝的触摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the touch of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 等等 让我们来看看是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 幸运的微笑 对你来说 又一个美酒玫瑰日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortune smiles. Another day of wine and roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说 就是啤酒和披萨饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your case, beer and pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.18,0:03:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动吧 伙计们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of here, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说过会让我活下去的！- 太对了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But you said you'd let me live! - Too true!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.28,0:04:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会活下去！没有比诱惑蝙蝠更有趣的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so you shall! Nothing's better than live bait to trap a bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.20,0:04:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真精彩的出场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,双面人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two-Face?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.47,0:04:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经死了两个警卫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}2 guards are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抓着第三个警卫当人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's holding a third hostage. Didn't see this one coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.21,0:04:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该能想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.81,0:04:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约第二个银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The 2nd Bank of Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,两周年纪念那天我抓到过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}2nd anniversary of the day I captured him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么能抵抗得住你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could he resist?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是切斯 马瑞典\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Chase Meridian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我邀请她来这里帮助这个案子 她的专长是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked her to come to here to consult on the case. She specializes in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.69,0:04:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,变态心理学 多重人性研究学 我读过你的专著\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psychology, multiple personalities. I read your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.13,0:04:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.33,0:04:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,朴实 很有见解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naive, but insightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受宠惹惊 不是每个女士的书都能放到你的床头柜上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm flattered. Not every girl makes a superhero's night table.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.03,0:04:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能他讲道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we reason with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.53,0:04:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他扣押了一个无辜的人质 - 不会有什么好事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's got innocent people up there. - It won't do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会不加思索地杀了他 - 我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He'll slaughter them without a thought. - Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,创伤足可以使一个人判若两人 成为双重人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A trauma powerful enough to create an alternate personality leaves one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:05:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是在一个是非混淆的世界里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a world where normal rules of right and wrong no longer apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就象你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.18,0:05:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看我可以写一本书关于把 自己打扮成会飞的啮齿动物的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could write a hell of a paper on a grown man dressing like a flying rodent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠不是啮齿动物马瑞典博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bats aren't rodents, Dr. Meridian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？这我不知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我切斯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And call me Chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便问一句 你有名字吗 还是就是蝙蝠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, do you have a first name, or do I call you Bats?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.21,0:05:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,砰的一声 晚会开始！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start the party with a bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常准时 就算是他自己的葬礼 我的孩子们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very punctual, even for his own funeral. Boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.06,0:05:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死蝙蝠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the Bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.09,0:06:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝麻开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open sesame.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你中计了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.26,0:08:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约市的好市民们 请注意了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention citizens of fair Gotham!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.03,0:08:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开保险箱 就能得到我们梦寐以求的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we open that safe, we'll have everything we ever wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,钞票象雨一样落在混乱的人群中\N{\fnArial\fs30}enough cash to rain down upon fair Gotham a glorious flood of chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你 我的朋友 只有死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}you, my boy, dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.14,0:08:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是沸腾的盐酸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's boiling acid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你的死 我们特意准备了盐酸 它使我们变成今天这样子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your dying pleasure, we are serving the acid that made us the men we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓紧了 - 好的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它拉走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haul away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.03,0:08:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对！把它拉得远远的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Haul away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把手给我 - 别让我掉下去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me your hand. - Don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,借你这个用一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must borrow this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:08:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的助听器！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my hearing aid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.48,0:09:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的鞋都化了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! My shoes are melting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.15,0:09:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:09:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 伙计们 扶他下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他扶下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻一点 轻一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的 年青人 镇定一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be all right. Just stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下他跑不了啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This'll fix him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧点 蝙蝠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 是的 是的 是的！我太高兴了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes, yes! Oh, happy day!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.17,0:10:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,永别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farewell forever to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这尖耳朵的夜老鼠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}pointy-eared night rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,头！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Face!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.23,0:11:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要治疗 投降吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need help. Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好地去死吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have the good taste to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见！\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.97,0:12:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚 尽管蝙蝠侠尽了所有努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite a valiant effort last night by Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 双面人哈利还是逃脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harvey Two-Face is still at large and extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的另一则新闻是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And another news today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.41,0:12:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在韦恩集团的电子分部取得了极大的成功之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}billionaire Bruce Wayne extended his profit-sharing program.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,亿万富翁布鲁斯 韦恩 扩大了他的员工分享利润计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the employees of the successful electronics branch of Wayne Enterprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的视察对我们分部是一个极大的鼓舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your inspections are a departmental highlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啦 是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.14,0:13:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个成功者 我是个成功者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a winner. I am a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.31,0:13:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个成功者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个成功者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物校正仪 气油替代品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bioremediation. Alternative fuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.89,0:13:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩先生 时间不早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wayne, look at that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该尽快回到研究所去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we should get to R & D as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,贵姓？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.60,0:13:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 韦恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.43,0:13:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那是我的名字 你的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's my name. And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,利格玛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nygma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.70,0:13:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.84,0:13:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华利格玛 是您亲自己雇用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward Nygma. You hired me personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是这样对大家说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like I tell everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.11,0:13:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我们从未见过面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've never actually met,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.91,0:13:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我的聘用书上有您的签名 我还保留着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your name was on the hiring slip. I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.15,0:13:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要把手拿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need that hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.65,0:14:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.69,0:14:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.35,0:14:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为您是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.09,0:14:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,您是我的偶像\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're my idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.83,0:14:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回去工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.89,0:14:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人痴心妄想要把咱们俩分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}And some people have been trying to keep us apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回去工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.37,0:14:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脑子里想些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确地说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.37,0:14:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么在我们的脑子里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's on all our minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑电波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brain waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.65,0:14:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在韦恩企业的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future of Wayne Enterprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是脑电波\N{\fnArial\fs30}is brain waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要向您道歉 韦恩先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must apologize, Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.82,0:14:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天早上我已经终止了他的研究项目 - 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I terminated his project today. - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做出来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的发明\N{\fnArial\fs30}My invention.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以把任何电子信号直接发射到人的大脑中去\N{\fnArial\fs30}beams any TV signal directly into the human brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.91,0:15:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺激人的神经系统 可以达到操纵人脑电波的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}By stimulating neurons, manipulating brain waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.81,0:15:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个装置可以使观众身临其境\N{\fnArial\fs30}this device makes the audience feel like they're inside the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.65,0:15:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要让一个毫无价值的世界 使我们变得粗暴残忍呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why be brutalized by an uncaring world?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说「操纵人的脑电波」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you say "manipulating brain waves"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.59,0:15:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.10,0:15:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,象您这种人永远不需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone like you would never need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.67,0:15:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,象您这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.77,0:15:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有智慧 有魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}intelligent, witty and.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.97,0:15:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈吐诙谐的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.67,0:15:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还需要一点点的资金来进行必要的人体试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a bit of additional funding for human trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.57,0:15:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我 让我做给你看 好吗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.55,0:15:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这项目的所有资料和图表给我 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a full set of schematics on this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.95,0:15:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们俩将是完全的合伙关系 布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be full partners in this, Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.65,0:15:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看！我们有多么地相象！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at us! Two of a kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.66,0:15:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,请打电话给我的助手玛格利塔 她会安排的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call my assistant, Margaret. She'll set something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.23,0:15:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}going to be good for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.17,0:15:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就要答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need an answer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.90,0:15:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 爱德华 答复是不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, then the answer is no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.77,0:16:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡乱创改并操纵人的脑电波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tampering with people's brain waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会引起太多的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}mind manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.55,0:16:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我不能答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}it just raises too many questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.65,0:16:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 谢谢大家 请继续努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, keep up the good work. Looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.42,0:16:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.89,0:16:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家回去工作吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.42,0:16:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回头再跟你算帐！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll discuss this later!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were supposed to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.35,0:16:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,椅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.36,0:16:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿福 - 我看见信号了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alfred. - I saw the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:16:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.77,0:17:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,局长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commissioner?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.81,0:17:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号是我发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.85,0:17:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天晚上在银行 我注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night I noticed something about Two-Face:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,双面人的硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}His coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.95,0:17:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他阿基里斯的脚踵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his Achilles' heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.79,0:18:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他唯一的致命的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can be exploited.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.39,0:18:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.96,0:18:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是为了这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You called me for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.73,0:18:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠信号不是寻呼机\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Batsignal is not a beeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能说 对你的兴趣仅限于工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could say that my interest in you was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.50,0:18:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}purely professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想引诱我吗 博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trying to get under my cape?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.97,0:18:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个姑娘不能整天只和精神病人打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl can't live by psychoses alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.04,0:18:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们都只喜欢我的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the car, right? Chicks love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.98,0:18:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it about the wrong kind of man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.01,0:18:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在高中的时候 那些带耳环的小伙子吸引我\N{\fnArial\fs30}In grade school: Guys with earrings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.55,0:18:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,大学时 是摩托车和皮夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}College: Motorcycles, leather jackets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑色橡胶\N{\fnArial\fs30}black rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.46,0:18:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找消防队员吧 他们穿得更少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try a fireman. Less to take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.17,0:18:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个工作我不介意 遗憾的是 看不见面具下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mind the work. Pity I can't see behind the mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都带着面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all wear masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.64,0:18:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一本打开的书 你想读吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life's an open book. You read?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.11,0:18:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是家庭野餐的好伴侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blend in at a family picnic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.75,0:18:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以试试嘛 我带酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could give it a try. I'll bring the wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带你自己就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you bring your scarred psyche.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.55,0:19:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很直接了当？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Direct, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢强壮的女人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like strong women.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作做完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done my homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.56,0:19:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要我穿上紧身衣拿着皮鞭子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do I need skintight vinyl and a whip?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在女人方面运气一向不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't had much luck with women.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.30,0:19:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许只是你没有遇到合适的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you just haven't met the right woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.48,0:19:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出了什么事？- 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.75,0:19:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有人误发了信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}False alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.68,0:19:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.10,0:19:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.25,0:20:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我做好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.22,0:20:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多的问题 是有很多问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many questions. There's too many questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.15,0:20:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我要让你知道 这能行！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.83,0:20:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过了 这个项目被终止了！我去叫保卫来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you this project is terminated! I'm calling security!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.77,0:20:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡因会要了你的命的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caffeine will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.31,0:20:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,该起床了 天竺鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise and shine, little guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.98,0:20:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快放开我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Untie me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不会疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This won't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少 我认为不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Least, I don't think it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底要做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.66,0:20:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你敢碰那个按纽的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You touch that switch and.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.49,0:20:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.18,0:21:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,图像失真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing resolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.18,0:21:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,加大强度！\N{\fnArial\fs30}More power!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.24,0:21:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华 利格玛上台了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward Nygma!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.84,0:21:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将是电视剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the next contestant on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.01,0:21:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸脑者下一个竞选者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brain Drain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你脑袋里的东西都掏出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take what's inside thick skull number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.55,0:21:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给准备些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have we got for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯帝格利 我有个突破性的进展！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Stickley, I'm having a breakthrough!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.06,0:21:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许会崩溃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a breakdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.96,0:21:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不管是什么 我是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nevertheless, I'm smarter. I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.06,0:21:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是几个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, several geniuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.30,0:22:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群嗡嗡作响的蜜蜂\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gaggle, a swarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.50,0:22:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一大群的弗洛伊德！\N{\fnArial\fs30}a flock of freaking Freuds!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.24,0:22:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜个谜语 富莱德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riddle me this, Fred.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.01,0:22:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西对一个人最重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is everything to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对其他人却一文不值？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nothing to everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.58,0:22:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的思想 宝贝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mind, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.51,0:22:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在正在操纵你的思想！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now mine pumps with the power of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.82,0:22:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在吸收你的IQ\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sucking up your IQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.29,0:22:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽空你的脑皮层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vacuuming your cortex.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.12,0:22:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,换取你的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeding off your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.01,0:22:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是惊心动魄！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才出了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.79,0:23:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个令人非常惊讶的副作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very surprising side effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.96,0:23:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你呈现在我的三维电视里时\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you were mesmerized by my 3-D TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.90,0:23:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我利用你的中心动力使自己变得聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used your neural energy to grow smarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.90,0:23:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 韦恩说得没错！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce Wayne was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.64,0:23:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个坏蛋 不道德的精神病患者！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You demented, bizarre, unethical toad!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.14,0:23:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是人脑操纵仪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is brain manipulation!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.37,0:23:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要向美国通信委员会报告！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm reporting you to the FCC!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.74,0:23:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即报告人体试验委员会！还有航空材料实验室！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human experimentation board! The AMI!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.61,0:23:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要报警！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.95,0:23:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会被指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are going up on charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.12,0:23:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将被送上法庭 被审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}to court, to jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.02,0:23:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会在精神病院度过你的余生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then to a mental institution forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.19,0:23:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 首先 利格玛 你被解雇了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, first and foremost, Nygma, you are fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.36,0:23:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了没有？你被解雇了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me? Fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.13,0:23:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.71,0:23:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.19,0:24:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,支持住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.19,0:24:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.79,0:24:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被解雇了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.96,0:24:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or should I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.43,0:24:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,完蛋了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}terminated?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.04,0:24:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 跳起来啊老家伙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surf's up, Big Kahuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.35,0:24:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,姿势不错 可入水不够好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice form, but rough on the landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.85,0:24:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不会拿到铜牌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may have to settle for the Bronze.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.42,0:24:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题？韦恩先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Questions, Mr. Wayne?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作会产生太多的问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My work raises too many questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.20,0:24:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why hasn't anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.87,0:24:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让你认清自己呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}put you in your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.84,0:24:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 登特 前纽约检查官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harvey Dent, once Gotham's District Attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.47,0:24:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,被地下组织头子莫罗尼严重毁容\N{\fnArial\fs30}was horribly scarred by underworld kingpin, Boss Moroni.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.24,0:25:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然蝙蝠侠极力挽救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although Batman tried to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.71,0:25:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但登特仍然变成一个凶残的犯罪份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dent's left-brain damage turned him into a violent criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.98,0:25:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他指责蝙蝠侠 后者发誓要亲手将他抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}who blamed Batman and who has vowed to destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.52,0:25:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,双面人哈利 是极端危险的人物 重复一遍 是极端危险的人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harvey Two-Face is extremely dangerous, repeat, extremely dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.19,0:25:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是戈登局长打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the Commissioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.19,0:25:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩集团出事故了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been an accident at Wayne Enterprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.83,0:25:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样子死太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horrible way to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.70,0:25:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这里有电子摄相监视器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The surveillance cameras are down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.97,0:25:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会尽快到河里打捞 不过怀疑能否找到尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll dredge the river, but with that current, I doubt we'll find the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.71,0:25:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.11,0:25:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.31,0:25:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.55,0:25:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两年来我们天天在一起工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two years working in the same office.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.09,0:25:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就象我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was like my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.16,0:25:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.76,0:25:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,或表兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a cousin that visits a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.49,0:25:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着 爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a grip, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.43,0:25:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要桌上发现这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this in my cubicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.33,0:25:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会发现笔迹和他一模一样 还有句法和拼法也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find the handwriting matches his, as does the sentence structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.51,0:26:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法在这儿继续工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't possibly continue on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.51,0:26:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.25,0:26:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是昨天晚上保卫科的录象\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is last night's security log.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.28,0:26:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是斯帝格利\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Stickley.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.83,0:26:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,相当明确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty cut and dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.50,0:26:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 肯定是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, definitely suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.84,0:26:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢 布鲁斯 咱们保持联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks very much for your help, Bruce. We'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.64,0:26:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯帝格利的自杀根本说不通 给他的家人全额补偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stickley's suicide doesn't make sense. I want full benefits for his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.55,0:26:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的保险条例不包括自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suicide's not covered by our policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.32,0:26:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 全额补偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Full benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.15,0:26:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,记者歌帝打过32次电话 你找谁谈慈善演出的事儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gossip Gerty called 32 times. Who are you taking to the Charity Circus?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.32,0:26:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没定下来 这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you know. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.16,0:26:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.49,0:26:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没见任何人送来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.64,0:27:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你看我脸上的数\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If you look at the numbers on my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.58,0:27:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远找不到13「\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't find 13 anyplace."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.44,0:27:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真荒唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.08,0:27:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.88,0:27:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个谜语\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.15,0:27:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我脸上的数 13 」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Numbers on my face 13."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.22,0:27:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,1到12\N{\fnArial\fs30}1 through 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.82,0:27:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是钟表\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is a clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.62,0:27:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁给你出谜语？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would send you a riddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.39,0:27:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 玛格利塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.89,0:27:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是个谜语\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.64,0:28:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜我今天做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess what I did today?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.63,0:28:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩庄园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wayne Manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.08,0:28:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.61,0:29:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见马瑞典博士 谢谢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Meridian, please. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.41,0:30:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.08,0:30:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我来早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}guess I'm early.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.02,0:30:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有预约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.88,0:30:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是布鲁斯 韦恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.89,0:30:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.29,0:30:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你有足够的钱给我买个新门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can afford a door.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.42,0:30:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.76,0:30:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我还以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sounded like you were in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.37,0:30:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我以为你碰上麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.31,0:30:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒宁可听到你反对合作暴力破门而入的解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer healthy expressions of violence as opposed to breaking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.48,0:30:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.95,0:30:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.75,0:30:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 有人不断给我写情书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's been sending me love letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.89,0:30:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一封送到我的办公室 还有一封送到了我家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}One at my office and one at my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.36,0:30:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈登局长认为你也许可以给我一些专家的忠告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commissioner Gordon thought you might give me your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.17,0:30:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是表\N{\fnArial\fs30}A clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.60,0:31:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.84,0:31:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,「撕下我的一个头\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Tear one off and scratch my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.88,0:31:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻轻一擦 黑变红「\N{\fnArial\fs30}what once was red is black instead."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.95,0:31:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是火柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}A match.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.36,0:31:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这写信的人是个不折不扣的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My opinion: This letter writer is a wacko.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.49,0:31:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wacko?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.16,0:31:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是专业性术语吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That a technical term?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.43,0:31:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,病人可能患有强迫性综合症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patient may suffer from obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.27,0:31:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,伴随潜在的杀人侵向 你对这个满意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with potential homicidal tendencies. Is that better for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.60,0:31:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 你认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what you're saying is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.44,0:31:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}this guy's a total wacko.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.44,0:31:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.51,0:31:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是在追逐你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's obsessed with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.31,0:31:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他唯一的出路就是清除这个不正常的偏爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}His only escape may be to purge the fixation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.88,0:31:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}To kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.82,0:31:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你的理解力很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you understand obsession better than you let on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.49,0:31:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢蝙蝠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like bats?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.96,0:31:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是测试图\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a Rorschach, Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.96,0:32:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,测墨迹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}An inkblot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.50,0:32:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们眼里看到的是他内心所想\N{\fnArial\fs30}People see what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.37,0:32:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的问题是：你喜欢蝙蝠吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, do you like bats?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.41,0:32:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在玩娃娃吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still playing with dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.84,0:32:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是马来西亚的梦女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a Malaysian dream warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.48,0:32:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有种文化相信它能保证你不做恶梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some cultures believe she protects you from bad dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.48,0:32:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定认为很傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's silly to you, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.36,0:32:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去那么悲哀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.49,0:32:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要一个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you need one?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.63,0:32:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？不 我要它干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? No. Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.97,0:32:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的内心和你的表面很不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not exactly what you seem, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.24,0:32:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟为什么而来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you really came here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.81,0:32:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yikes, time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.65,0:32:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常这句话由我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's usually my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.68,0:32:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常乐意呆在这儿跟你聊一聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to stay here chatting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.75,0:32:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.98,0:32:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.05,0:32:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须让你脱掉这些衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must get you out of those clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.52,0:33:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.99,0:33:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,换上黑色礼服\N{\fnArial\fs30}And into a black dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.13,0:33:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 博士你喜欢看马戏吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, doctor, do you like the circus?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.48,0:33:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.72,0:33:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}boys and girls of all ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.02,0:33:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到世界上最伟大的马戏表演！\N{\fnArial\fs30}welcome to the greatest show on earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.89,0:33:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你在一起的那位漂亮女士是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this beautiful young woman you're with?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.89,0:33:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,切斯 马瑞典博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Chase Meridian.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.39,0:33:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.63,0:33:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的博士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.50,0:33:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚是为纽约儿童医院募捐的慈善演出\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Gotham Children's Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.73,0:33:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们感谢最伟大的捐助人：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's thank our largest single donor:
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.37,0:33:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 韦恩先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce Wayne!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.21,0:33:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.64,0:33:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在距地面70英尺的上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}70 feet above the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.01,0:33:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞人世家将为大家表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}performing feats of unimaginable aerial skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.02,0:34:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人惊叹的绝技\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Flying Graysons!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.47,0:34:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.57,0:35:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个周末我要去攀岩 你愿不愿意和我一起去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going rock climbing this weekend. Would you join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.35,0:35:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是很想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.28,0:35:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢攀岩 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love climbing. I really love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.28,0:35:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.95,0:35:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've met someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.62,0:35:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太快了 你刚搬来不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fast work. You just moved here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.29,0:35:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以说 他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could say he.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.09,0:35:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,从天而降\N{\fnArial\fs30}dropped out of the sky and.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.96,0:35:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,砰！\N{\fnArial\fs30}bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.63,0:35:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他也有这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he felt it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.47,0:35:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.87,0:35:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.64,0:35:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会没有呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wouldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.31,0:35:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.98,0:35:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.18,0:35:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞人世家最年青的一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}the youngest flying Grayson.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.51,0:35:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将为大家表现最精彩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}will perform the awe-inspiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.85,0:35:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡之约\N{\fnArial\fs30}death drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.09,0:35:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.72,0:35:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全网\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a net!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.94,0:36:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,请大家欣赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.61,0:36:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.98,0:36:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.58,0:36:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.28,0:36:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在国际马戏团新的经理请大家忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the new management of the circus invites you to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.15,0:36:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这美好健康的美国娱乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}this good, wholesome fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.69,0:36:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,来和我们一起庆祝事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}and join us in a celebration of chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.43,0:36:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有正式的公正！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and true jesters!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.20,0:37:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿下来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.13,0:37:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.71,0:37:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 我们有一个新的节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, a new act for your.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.21,0:37:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们叫它 天顶下的大屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}personal amazement. We call it Massacre under the Big Top.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.92,0:37:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 大家注意看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us direct your attention to the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.69,0:37:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,正中央 在几个外表美丽的球体里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside this harmless-Iooking orb are two.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.29,0:37:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有200根炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's two hundred sticks of TNT.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.10,0:37:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆遥控器\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in our innocent hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.50,0:37:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就放在我的手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}a radio detonator.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.10,0:37:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.00,0:37:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,市长大人 要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want, Mr. Mayor?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.84,0:37:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单 我要蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}One simple thing: Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.84,0:37:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,撕碎他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruised, broken, bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.01,0:37:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要他死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a word: Dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.25,0:37:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.68,0:37:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们面前都是些什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do we have before us?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.02,0:37:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotham's finest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.79,0:37:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,最有影响力\N{\fnArial\fs30}well-to-do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.02,0:38:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,最显赫的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}influential.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.19,0:38:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你们当中 一定有人知道谁是蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely one of you knows who Batman is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.63,0:38:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们中一个脸色苍白的家伙就是蝙蝠侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, odds are one of you pasty-faced twits is Batman!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.26,0:38:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有两分种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.74,0:38:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harvey!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.74,0:38:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蝙蝠侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Batman!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.36,0:38:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能制止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.66,0:38:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,从钢丝上爬过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go out on the rigging.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.06,0:38:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.90,0:38:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.02,0:39:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去吧 孩子们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to work, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.71,0:39:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,正合我意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our kind of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.52,0:39:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住它！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reach for it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.39,0:39:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.12,0:41:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让他住在这太好了 他什么亲人也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good you took him in. He hasn't anyone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.42,0:41:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,整天录证词 没有吃饭 没有睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}He filled out papers all day. He hasn't slept or eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.94,0:41:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你格里森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, Master Grayson.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.77,0:41:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿福来德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.41,0:41:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近如何 Al？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.41,0:41:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你准备一个房间 但也许你想先吃饭？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a room prepared for you. But perhaps you'd like to eat first.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.19,0:41:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我要离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.96,0:42:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.12,0:42:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉那个警察我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Telling that cop I'd stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.56,0:42:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让我少受点那些社工接见\N{\fnArial\fs30}saved me a lot of social service interviews.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.13,0:42:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不反对 也不感谢 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no offense, but no thanks. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.90,0:42:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.95,0:42:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里？戏团一定在去大都会的半路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where will you go? The circus must be halfway to Metropolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.02,0:42:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,给双脸人一点颜色瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a fix on Two-Face.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.85,0:42:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.85,0:42:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀掉他不会让痛苦消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing Two-Face won't take the pain away.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.69,0:42:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会更痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.29,0:42:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别给我说教好不好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare me the sermons, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.13,0:42:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你的忠告或怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need your advice or your charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.37,0:42:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.87,0:42:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多车手酒吧外头停着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang out at a lot of biker bars?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.84,0:42:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你油箱快空拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're almost on empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.01,0:42:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,到汽车间加一下吧 路上没有加油站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fill it up in the garage. There's no gas station for miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.19,0:43:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,油泵在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pump's over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.85,0:43:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是汽车间还是汽车博物馆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a garage or a car museum, Bruce?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.63,0:43:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是1917年的哈雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}A 1917 Harley.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.30,0:43:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.70,0:43:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第安型的 完全修复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indian Classic, fully restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.91,0:43:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是文森特黑骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a Vincent Black Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.54,0:43:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只限量生产100部\N{\fnArial\fs30}They only made 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.24,0:43:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,101 实际上 我的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred and one, actually. She's my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.41,0:43:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有两部\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got two.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.08,0:43:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那辆坏掉啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one doesn't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.42,0:43:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,节流阀拆到这部上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throttle sticks on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.85,0:43:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿福来德的好技师 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred's a good mechanic, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.56,0:43:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要大量工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}these need a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.02,0:43:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人修得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone were to fix them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.93,0:43:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以拿一辆走\N{\fnArial\fs30}they could keep one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.56,0:43:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.86,0:43:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅途愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}have a nice trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.10,0:43:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll land on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.31,0:43:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,小少爷要走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the young master leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.81,0:43:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.08,0:44:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我得扔掉这些 也许狗想吃呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just toss this away then. Perhaps the dogs are hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.48,0:44:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 阿尔 等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Al, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.80,0:46:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯主人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Bruce?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.64,0:46:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,象我的双亲一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.24,0:46:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.91,0:46:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼又从黑夜跑出来啦 一声尖叫 两声枪响\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monster comes out of the night, a scream, two shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.42,0:46:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.25,0:46:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.25,0:46:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他杀害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.52,0:46:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,双脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two-Face.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.02,0:46:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他屠杀那孩子的双亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He slaughtered that boy's parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.42,0:46:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.13,0:46:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说；「是我害的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said, "I killed them."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.77,0:46:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,照看好那个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.71,0:46:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.19,0:47:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我帮你放好 格里森少爷？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you settle in, Master Grayson?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.52,0:47:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.92,0:47:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我不会呆很长时间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, I won't be staying long.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.20,0:47:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是知更鸟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this a robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.03,0:47:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥的钢丝有一次断过 我荡过去抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother's wire broke once and I swung out and grabbed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.24,0:47:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲说我是他的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father said I was his hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.78,0:47:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我飞的象知更鸟一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I flew in like a robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.31,0:47:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明我是一个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some hero I turned out to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.42,0:47:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your father was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.75,0:47:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你 你是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a hero. I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.20,0:47:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔掉这个好不好？我不再需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw this away, will you? I won't need it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.13,0:47:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我就把它放在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll just put it in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.14,0:47:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,及时修一下坏翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broken wings mend in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.85,0:48:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天知更鸟会再次起飞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day Robin will fly again.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.58,0:48:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.37,0:49:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.33,0:51:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,困惑者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Puzzler?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.27,0:51:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,赌徒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Gamester?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.71,0:51:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人船长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.32,0:51:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,问号面具人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question Mark Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.24,0:51:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 太感谢拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.55,0:51:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠顽固地拒绝退场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bat's stubborn refusal to expire.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.82,0:52:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快让大家发疯啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}is driving us insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.16,0:52:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.50,0:52:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就能杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll kill him soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.17,0:52:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.94,0:52:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你准备好你喜欢的：\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.01,0:52:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,发泡的香槟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sparkling champagne and.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.54,0:52:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,水煮鲑鱼 小鹌鹑蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}yummy poached salmon with little quail eggs and a.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.95,0:52:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶油\N{\fnArial\fs30}creamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.72,0:52:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}dreamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.09,0:52:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,柠檬蛋奶酥\N{\fnArial\fs30}lemon souffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.39,0:52:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我的才是你喜欢的：\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I made your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.62,0:52:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,烤透的黑野猪心\N{\fnArial\fs30}A charred heart of black boar.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.46,0:52:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一大片驴排骨肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}a side of raw donkey meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.23,0:52:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,烈性酒 干脆点 宝贝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a Sterno and grain alcohol, straight up, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.10,0:52:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.80,0:52:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人 把我们宠坏啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies, you spoil us!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.60,0:52:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在犹豫的是该先吃哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're of two minds about what to eat first.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.68,0:52:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.68,0:52:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你们准备着加座\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you made extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.68,0:52:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪个混蛋？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.35,0:53:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.08,0:53:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你可以叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.45,0:53:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谜语者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Riddler.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.39,0:53:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要叫你死鬼 那还差不多！你怎样找到这儿来的？说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you dead, is more like it! How did you find us? Talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.46,0:53:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过如果我说出来 那会让你不忍心下手杀我 我的与世隔绝者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then if I talked what would keep you from slaying me, O Segregated One?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.10,0:53:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便我得说 不停止采摘就无法收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's never going to heal if you don't stop picking.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.10,0:53:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你会不会流绿血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if you bleed green.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.94,0:53:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想杀的不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not me you want to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.94,0:53:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,象你这样强大的人当然太容易就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just too easy for someone as powerful as you and.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.28,0:53:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.15,0:53:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.02,0:53:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.35,0:53:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀掉蝙蝠！听起来主意不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the Bat! Sounds like a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.46,0:53:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你是否仔细想过？几个子弹 飞溅的鲜血 ？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But have you thought it through? A few bullets, a splash of blood, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.30,0:53:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄湿的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wet hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.70,0:53:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,狂杀后的沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Post-homicidal depression.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.14,0:53:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不先戏弄他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not humiliate him first?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.14,0:53:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.94,0:54:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他暴露弱点 然后 在他最虚弱的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expose his frailties. Then, when he is at his weakest.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.78,0:54:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}crush him!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.68,0:54:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.52,0:54:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你左边的眼睛在闪闪发光\N{\fnArial\fs30}sparkle in your left eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.95,0:54:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你对付蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help you get Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.29,0:54:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, if you'II.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.10,0:54:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就得让我多活一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}spare my life for just a few moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.34,0:54:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.41,0:54:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你在那里干的事 给房子和花来上一点重金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love what you've done here. Heavy Metal meets House and Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.68,0:54:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.15,0:54:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此黑暗 哥特\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so dark and Gothic and.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.92,0:54:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,颓废\N{\fnArial\fs30}disgustingly decadent.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.76,0:54:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时却又如此的轻快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet so bright and chipper and.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.03,0:54:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}conservative.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.54,0:55:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就象你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so you!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.97,0:55:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 也象你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, so you!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.21,0:55:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很少有人兼具冬天和春天的双重品格 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very few people are both a summer and a winter, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.08,0:55:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却拥有\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you pull it off nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.35,0:55:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说出重点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.09,0:55:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人可告诉过你 你有严重的冲动失控症？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone ever told you you have a serious impulse-control problem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.23,0:55:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.74,0:55:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我找到你的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.21,0:55:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来给你示范一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me demonstrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.98,0:55:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的大脑在Box里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your brain on the Box.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.49,0:55:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的大脑在Box里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.49,0:55:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是有人觉得象一只煎熟的鸡蛋？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anyone else feel like a fried egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.99,0:55:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have more.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.99,0:56:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,会再来的 先放过一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more. But only the first one's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.10,0:56:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是契约：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the bargain:
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.87,0:56:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要帮我拿下大都会制造\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll help me steal production capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.70,0:56:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把盒子放到这个城市的所有电视机里\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can put a Box on every TV in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.74,0:56:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为纽约这个愚人村里的智者 碳基生命形态！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and become Gotham's cleverest carbon-based life form!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.81,0:56:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.41,0:56:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都听好啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everybody paying attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.98,0:56:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要帮你解开一个最大的谜底\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will help you solve the greatest riddle of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.92,0:56:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个谜语中的谜语：\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mother of all riddles:
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.59,0:56:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底谁是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.43,0:56:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batman?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.83,0:56:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你擅闯私地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke into our hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.23,0:56:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,玷污这个居所的纯洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You violated the sanctity of our lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.93,0:56:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,应当把你的骨头碾碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should crush your bones into powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.77,0:56:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你有一个有趣的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you pose an interesting proposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.21,0:56:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 正：接受提议 反：打下你的狗头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, heads, we accept, and tails, we blow your damn head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.93,0:57:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.49,0:57:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.76,0:57:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.10,0:57:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别管那个 我来 - 我不习惯等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leave that. I'll attend to it. - I'm not used to being waited on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.50,0:57:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要朝我开枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shoot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.06,0:57:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要瞪着我！给我那个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't eyeball me! Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.90,0:57:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,双脸 给我看看怎样揍他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two-Face, show me how to punch a guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.61,0:57:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个简单小兄弟 捏好你的拳头 收回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dead simple, my boy. Ball up your fist, reach back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.94,0:57:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and assert yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.28,0:57:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很有趣 我来试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks fun. Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.05,0:58:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,捏起拳头 收回来 爽一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ball up the fist, reach way back assert yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.49,0:58:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,十万 2百20\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hundred thousand, two hundred and twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.66,0:58:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘记数字啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost count!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.07,0:58:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天夜间的另一起抢劫案 由绿衣危险分子干下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night another robbery, perpetrated by the green-suited menace.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.67,0:58:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成上百万价值的钻石被盗 蝙蝠侠事先未提出警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}resulting in millions in diamonds stolen, with no sign of Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.41,0:58:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,双脸组成的团伙 这个新的犯罪样式\N{\fnArial\fs30}This new criminal's pattern of marking his crimes with puzzles.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.94,0:58:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据他犯罪时所带的标记 纽约居民称之为谜语人\N{\fnArial\fs30}has Gothamites calling him The Riddler.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.28,0:58:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然你和蝙蝠侠有个共同的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, you and Batman have a common enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.12,0:58:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是早间邮件一起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was with the morning mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.22,0:58:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们8个往前走 不回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The eight of us go forth, not back, to protect our king.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.56,0:58:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护国王被攻击「\N{\fnArial\fs30}from attack."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.06,0:58:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,象棋的兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chess pawns.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.30,0:58:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.60,0:58:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,火柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.37,0:58:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,固体 人造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All man-made objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.30,0:58:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,尺寸小分量轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small in size, light in weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.74,0:58:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,相互的联系在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the connection?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.17,0:58:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是他被叫做谜语者的道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, that's why they call him The Riddler.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.54,0:59:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要我帮你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.55,0:59:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么只有这个是锁上的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is this the only locked door?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.28,0:59:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那后头有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.22,0:59:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩先生死去的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Wayne's dead wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.62,0:59:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是银器室\N{\fnArial\fs30}The silver closet. On your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.29,0:59:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你们可以自己成为情节的一部分！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you can be part of the action!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.96,0:59:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,利格玛技术把3D娱乐带到你的家庭！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nygma Tech brings the joy of 3-D entertainment into your home!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.24,0:59:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士先生们 我来告诉大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, let me tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.77,0:59:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}my vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.61,0:59:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在美国 让每一个家庭都拥有一个Box\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Box in every home in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.68,0:59:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 全世界！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one day, the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.18,0:59:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,本地新闻 爱德华利格玛的3D-Box\N{\fnArial\fs30}In local news, Edward Nygma's 3-D Box.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.12,0:59:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经成为纽约城疯狂的时尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}has become the rage of Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.69,0:59:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天晚上售罄一空的电子商店发生混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rioting occurred last night at electronic stores that were sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.62,0:59:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎没有一个家庭不拥有一个Box\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is hardly a home without the Nygma Tech Box.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.66,0:59:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,评论认为Box把纽约居民变成巫术信徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Critics claim the Box turns Gothamites into zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.93,0:59:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但爱德华利格玛仅仅耸耸他的肩膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Edward Nygma just shrugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.73,1:00:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,「电视机刚出现的时候他们也是这样说的 」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"That's what they said when TV was invented."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.98,1:00:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克少爷！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Dick!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.75,1:00:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.92,1:00:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just checking, young sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.08,1:01:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵警报 入侵警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruder alert. Intruder alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.68,1:01:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有东西要给你 在桌上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something for you. It's on the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.22,1:01:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你喜欢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.56,1:02:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以叫它临床直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it clinical intuition.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.60,1:02:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你的梦想需要有一些改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought your dreams needed changing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.20,1:02:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的双亲被杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents were murdered before me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.84,1:02:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我还是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.51,1:02:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.38,1:02:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不记得发生的大部分情况 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}remember a lot of what happened, but.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.85,1:02:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我做梦的时候常常有这样的东西 闪光\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I do comes to me in my dreams. Flashes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.19,1:02:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一些新的东西 虽然 我以前不曾看到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a new element now though, I haven't seen before.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.99,1:02:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一本红皮书\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a red leather book.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.53,1:02:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.53,1:02:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我醒过来发现它又出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dreams come to me when I'm awake now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.67,1:02:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 你描述的是一种被压抑的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce, you're describing repressed memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.47,1:02:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗忘的痛苦景象试图重新浮现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Images of a forgotten pain that's trying to surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.05,1:02:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.93,1:03:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能你双亲的死状你并不是真正看见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there an aspect of your parents' death you haven't faced?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.31,1:03:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情发生的时候你还很年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were so young when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.08,1:03:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我该让你两个单独呆在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should leave you two alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.65,1:03:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个可不单单是把工作带回家这样简单？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This goes way beyond taking your work home, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.49,1:03:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.66,1:03:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他是有魅力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.26,1:03:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clinically.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.93,1:03:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人为何要做这些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does a man do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.93,1:03:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎他曾经被下过罚他苦行的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as if he's cursed to pay penance.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.60,1:03:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是怎样的罪过让他夜夜受到这样的煎熬？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What crime could he have committed to deserve a life of nightly torture?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.94,1:03:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个不仅仅是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more than just.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.54,1:04:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,专业兴趣 是不是 切斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}professional interest, isn't it, Chase?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.24,1:04:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 你嫉妒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce, are you jealous?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.71,1:04:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.78,1:04:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会为蝙蝠侠嫉妒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be jealous of Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.49,1:04:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想靠近你 但你不让我接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be close, but you won't let me near.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.32,1:04:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有何东西是要向我隐藏的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you protecting me from?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.76,1:04:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to know me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.33,1:04:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道我是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.20,1:04:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.34,1:04:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're all two people.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.71,1:04:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个在白天 另一个藏在阴影里\N{\fnArial\fs30}One daylight, and the one we keep in shadow.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.98,1:04:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,狂怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rage.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.48,1:04:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,强暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}violence.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.08,1:04:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,激情\N{\fnArial\fs30}passion.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.49,1:04:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.39,1:04:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.72,1:04:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉打扰你 我有一些关于迪克的烦事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to bother you. I have some distressing news about Dick.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.33,1:04:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.50,1:04:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕迪克少爷已经外出啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid Master Dick has gone traveling.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.47,1:05:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑出去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ran away?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.94,1:05:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 是开着车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, he took the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.37,1:05:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开的美洲豹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He boosted the Jag?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.24,1:05:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the Jaguar.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.64,1:05:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一辆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other car.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.24,1:05:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,本特利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bentley?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.31,1:05:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.65,1:05:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other car.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.85,1:05:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来坐坐我这辆可爱的车 宝贝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for a little ride in my love machine, babies?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.35,1:05:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是蝙蝠侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Batman!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.89,1:05:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开吧 蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up, Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.33,1:05:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.39,1:06:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是蝙蝠侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not Batman!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.86,1:06:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的啥意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.33,1:06:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是蝙蝠男孩！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Batboy!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.70,1:06:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是蝙蝠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't the Bat!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.52,1:06:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.70,1:06:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪一个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.87,1:06:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.37,1:06:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘带我的工作服 好不好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot my suit, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.81,1:07:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.58,1:07:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠从未吻过女孩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't Batman ever kiss the girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.32,1:07:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.16,1:07:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 你救我一命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, you saved my life!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.16,1:07:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以直接跑进这辆超级英雄快车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could definitely get into this superhero gig.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.25,1:08:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batman!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.27,1:08:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,私生子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.93,1:08:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不该是你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should've been you!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.10,1:08:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在剧场告诉双脸你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you had told Two-Face who you were at the circus.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.67,1:08:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就都会还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd still be alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.81,1:08:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果布鲁斯威恩能够替你的双亲去死 他会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Bruce Wayne could've given his life for your family, he would have.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.65,1:08:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我天天想的就是抓住双脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I can think about every day is getting Two-Face.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.23,1:08:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他占据我的整个生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.33,1:08:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was out there tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.33,1:08:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想象跟我打的就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I imagined it was him I was fighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.67,1:08:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至当我打你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}even when I was fighting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.97,1:08:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛苦消失啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the pain went away.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.21,1:09:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你理解？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.88,1:09:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.58,1:09:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.05,1:09:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须帮我找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must help me find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.85,1:09:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.35,1:09:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我来杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who kills him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.72,1:09:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 你想让你的整个生活？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're willing to take a life?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.16,1:09:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,都围绕着双脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as it's Two-Face.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.90,1:09:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情肯定会这样：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it will happen this way:
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.40,1:09:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make the kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.40,1:09:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的痛苦不会消失 反而会生长\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your pain doesn't die with Harvey, it grows.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.67,1:09:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会钻到黑夜里去找另一个脸 一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you run into the night to find another face, and another.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.11,1:09:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and another.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.31,1:09:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到一天早晨你发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}until one terrible morning you wake up and realize.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.92,1:09:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇已经成为你整个的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}that revenge has become your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.05,1:09:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道这一切如何发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you won't know why.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.09,1:09:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.42,1:09:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家人被一个疯子残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your family wasn't killed by a maniac.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.03,1:09:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, they were.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.83,1:09:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.73,1:10:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果一样 何不帮助我 训练我 让我做你的搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're the same, help me. Train me, let me be your partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.51,1:10:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.04,1:10:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.11,1:10:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有别的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.88,1:10:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.28,1:10:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你喜不喜欢 我已经成为这个事情的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a part of this, like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.87,1:10:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚整个纽约社交界都来参加他的宴会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight all of Gotham society has turned out for Edward Nygma's.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.57,1:10:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,庆祝他的新产品Box的发布\N{\fnArial\fs30}gala unveiling of his New Improved Box.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.68,1:10:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你阿尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Al.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.01,1:10:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的荣幸 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pleasure, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.21,1:10:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将要宴聚 跳舞到天亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be dining and dancing the night away.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.91,1:10:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在纽约里兹饭店的屋顶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the glamorous roof of the Ritz Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.03,1:11:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脸出现在所有杂志的所有角落你有何感想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it like to have your face on the cover of every magazine?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.67,1:11:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华 成为这个城市新进的钻石王老五有何感想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward, how does it feel to be the city's newest, most eligible bachelor?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.97,1:11:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约必须知道！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotham must know!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.67,1:11:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是布鲁斯威恩！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Bruce Wayne!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.54,1:11:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brucie!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.01,1:11:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 爱迪 他真伶俐！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Eddie, he is too cute!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.75,1:11:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿这个套装怎就找不到这个感觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you don't look so good in that suit?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.12,1:11:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你是来工作的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. You're here to work!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.16,1:11:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的胎记如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's my mole?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.42,1:11:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.03,1:11:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nygma技术收购威恩娱乐的传言你如何评价？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about rumors of a Nygma Tech takeover of Wayne Enterprises?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.13,1:11:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nygma技术的股票比威恩娱乐超卖一倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nygma Tech stock is outselling Wayne Enterprises 2 to 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.56,1:11:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨天的新闻吧 布鲁斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you yesterday's news, Bruce?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.44,1:11:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 老先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce, old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.54,1:11:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,报道说到超卖 超值 超量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The press wonders what it's like to be outsold, outclassed, out-coiffed and.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.21,1:11:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,超任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}generally outdone in every way.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.21,1:11:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 爱德华 祝贺你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Edward. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.78,1:11:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,盛大的宴会 漂亮的套装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great party. Nice suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.42,1:11:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wit. Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.25,1:12:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.56,1:12:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,切斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chase.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.19,1:12:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定在进行一个非常重要的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what a grand pursuit you must be.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.90,1:12:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是布鲁斯威恩 小姐 ？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Bruce Wayne, Miss?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.13,1:12:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以随便叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can call me anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.57,1:12:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.64,1:12:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}the future!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.64,1:12:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我新近开发的Box将提供给你全新的交互全息幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}My New Improved Box offers fully-interactive holographic fantasies.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.23,1:12:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华 你真是天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward, you're dashing and a genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.00,1:12:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎样创造出这些影象的 宝贝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you create these images, hon?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.21,1:12:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 亲爱的 是我的小秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, my dear, is my little secret.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.28,1:13:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,交互式全息图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fully-interactive holographs.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.42,1:13:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,定向高频载波 射入大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a high-frequency carrier wave, beamed into the brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.99,1:13:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能够创造这些影象\N{\fnArial\fs30}could create such images.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.76,1:13:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想研究一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you wish you thought of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.23,1:13:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要做痛苦的失败者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a sore loser.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.43,1:13:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,走进去 试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step inside. Give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.93,1:13:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能够让影象进入思想 还有啥东西可以阻挡你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can introduce images into the mind, what stops you from.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.77,1:13:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,把影象从思想里提取出来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}extracting images out of the mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.14,1:13:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢试用我的机器？只能这样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too timid to try my machine? Just say so.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.21,1:13:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳个舞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we dance?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.74,1:13:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,调皮鬼 调皮鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naughty, naughty.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.34,1:14:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,找东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for something?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.04,1:14:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是在想如何关掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just wondering how you turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.55,1:14:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.65,1:14:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.82,1:14:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.28,1:14:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 威恩先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.62,1:14:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.22,1:14:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me your.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.62,1:14:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.63,1:14:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.13,1:14:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}your fantasies.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.57,1:15:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me your secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.00,1:15:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.54,1:15:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最深\N{\fnArial\fs30}your deepest.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.61,1:15:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,最黑暗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}darkest.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.21,1:15:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}fears.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.28,1:15:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家放松！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, folks!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.84,1:15:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是老派的 低技术的强盗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only an old-fashioned low-tech stick-up!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.28,1:15:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我门感兴趣的东西是：\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're interested in the basics!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.42,1:15:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现金 珠宝 移动电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cash, jewelry, cellular telephones.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.95,1:15:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点安静地交出来 不会受到伤害！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand them over nice and quietly, and no one will be hurt!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.56,1:16:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急 阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.06,1:16:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.37,1:16:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家安静！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be calm, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.24,1:16:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持安静！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.80,1:16:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.61,1:16:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毁掉我的宴会！你有病？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ruining my big party! Are you insane?!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.41,1:16:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你把蝙蝠侠送过来等的心焦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're sick of waiting for you to deliver Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.18,1:16:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心的 双重人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience, O Bifurcated One.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.42,1:16:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心 去他的 我想让他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience, hell, we want him dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.62,1:16:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次小小的伤害和谋杀最有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nothing brings out the Batman like a little murder and mayhem!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.42,1:16:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会让我被抓住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have let me in on the caper.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.13,1:16:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以组织 计划 预售电影改编权\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could have organized it, planned it pre-sold the movie rights!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.91,1:16:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的出场不错 他的更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your entrance was good, his was better.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.62,1:17:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不同在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The difference?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.96,1:17:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,表演技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showmanship!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.96,1:17:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急 阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.50,1:17:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.37,1:17:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能先点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could be fired for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.44,1:17:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我得回到白金汉宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go back to Buckingham Palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.25,1:17:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 孩子们内第二阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, boys! Phase Two!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.76,1:17:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,半夜 我的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}My place, midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.80,1:18:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有比瓦斯更坏的环境啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing like a bad case of gas!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.80,1:19:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎就老不肯死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you just die?!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.71,1:20:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.72,1:20:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.49,1:20:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你处于一种无法感谢的尴尬境地你可知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a real gratitude problem, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.39,1:20:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得起个名 蝙蝠小子？飞武士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a name. Batboy? Knight Wing?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.53,1:20:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭档该起个怎样的名？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a good sidekick name?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.90,1:20:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,「迪克格雷森 大学生」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dick Grayson, college student."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.10,1:20:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚蛋吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.37,1:20:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救你 你欠我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved your life. You owe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.60,1:20:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会让自己被杀死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to get yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.04,1:20:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your new partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.37,1:20:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.04,1:20:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你晚上到哪里 我都会看着 蝙蝠侠到哪里 我都会跟着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever you go out at night, I'll be watching. Where Batman goes, I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.78,1:20:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如何阻止我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will you stop me?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.32,1:21:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can stop you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.39,1:21:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个跟蝙蝠装挂到一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang this next to the Batsuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.49,1:21:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它属于那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}where it belongs.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.60,1:21:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你鼓励他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're encouraging him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.77,1:21:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀着复仇之心的年轻人要给一点鼓励\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young men with a mind for revenge need little encouragement.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.70,1:21:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要引导\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need guidance.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.91,1:21:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 首先必须知道你的生活是你自己选择的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, above all, should know the consequences of the life you choose.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.85,1:21:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至切斯都说蝙蝠侠是在受罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Chase calls being Batman a curse.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.39,1:21:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这位小姐就是一种医治方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the lady's just what the doctor ordered.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.39,1:21:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看上去可爱聪慧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She seems lovely and wise.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.36,1:21:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我从未爱过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been in love before.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.36,1:21:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.27,1:21:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把感情告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.17,1:21:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想要的是蝙蝠侠 不是布鲁斯威恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants Batman, not Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.51,1:21:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her decide.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.86,1:22:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.33,1:22:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.97,1:23:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从第一次见你就盼望这个时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've imagined this moment since I first saw you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.44,1:23:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.84,1:23:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴唇\N{\fnArial\fs30}your lips.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.84,1:23:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your body.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.38,1:23:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我能够得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I have you and.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.98,1:23:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却希望这是另外一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm wishing you were somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.12,1:23:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜想总有一天女孩会长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess a girl has to grow up sometime.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.96,1:23:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我碰到一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've met someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.44,1:23:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.24,1:23:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you can understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.68,1:23:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.25,1:23:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.58,1:24:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正是我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just what I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.35,1:24:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我在教我的小狗狗一个新玩意：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I taught my doggie a new trick:
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.75,1:24:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何勾画出人心\N{\fnArial\fs30}How to map the human mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.99,1:24:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想看到布鲁斯威恩脑袋里的东西不想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to see what Bruce Wayne has in his head?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.50,1:24:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜我这个：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riddle me this:
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.97,1:24:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of man.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.91,1:24:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑袋里有蝙蝠在飞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}has bats on the brain?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.75,1:24:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 你猜的到 - 你是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go ahead. You can say it. - You're a genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.58,1:24:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.52,1:25:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 从今天起\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, from this day on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.99,1:25:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠不再存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batman is no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.23,1:25:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可以退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.96,1:25:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,外头还有罪恶 蝙蝠侠必须保护无辜者\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's monsters out there. Batman has to protect the innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.40,1:25:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经把自己献身给帮助我不认识的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've dedicated my life to helping strangers I've never met.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.50,1:25:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未见过的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faces I've never seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.81,1:25:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.51,1:25:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,无辜者不会再无脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}the innocent aren't faceless anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.91,1:25:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能告诉我我的余生该怎样干\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't tell me what to do with the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.92,1:25:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲对我说各人走自己的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad told me that every man goes his own way.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.12,1:25:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的路通向双脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}My way goes to Two-Face.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.59,1:25:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须帮助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.82,1:25:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你找到哈维\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you do find Harvey.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.06,1:25:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.66,1:25:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那以后呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what next?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.80,1:25:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.63,1:25:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会象我一样孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you'd be alone, like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.87,1:25:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你必须让我去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you must let this go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.17,1:25:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, I'm your friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.04,1:25:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要一个朋友 我需要一个搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need a friend, I need a partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.98,1:25:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,双脸必须偿还\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two-Face has got to pay.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.25,1:26:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.59,1:26:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,切斯来吃晚饭 我会告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chase is coming for dinner. I'm going to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.99,1:26:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.53,1:26:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,上楼来 好好谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come upstairs. We'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.58,1:26:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚上好 - 晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good evening. - Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.48,1:26:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,万圣节快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.98,1:26:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,万圣节快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy Halloween to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.98,1:27:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你今晚到这里来是想告诉你一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked you here tonight because there's something I wanted to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.39,1:27:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想告诉你一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to tell you something too.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.19,1:27:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.63,1:27:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,说下去 你先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, you first.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.24,1:27:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个诡计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trick or treat!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.77,1:27:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my life I have been.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.71,1:27:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,都被一个真正的男人吸引\N{\fnArial\fs30}attracted to a certain kind of man.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.24,1:27:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wrong kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.05,1:27:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我过的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look what I do for a living.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.65,1:27:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.25,1:27:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从遇见你 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}since I met you, I.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.79,1:27:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.56,1:27:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是发神经？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I so nervous?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.24,1:28:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚别吃的太多 会在床上生病的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't eat too much tonight or you'll be sick in your beds.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.50,1:28:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,万圣节快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy Halloween!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.19,1:28:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.72,1:28:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's happening again.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.26,1:28:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flashes.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.26,1:28:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家人的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents' death.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.00,1:29:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的记忆想冲出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your memories are trying to surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.60,1:29:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉你一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.70,1:29:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前从未对别人说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I've never told anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.70,1:29:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.17,1:29:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.25,1:29:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.12,1:29:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我家人的守丧夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night of my parents' wake.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.95,1:29:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,神甫的话不能让我平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}the priest's words gave no comfort.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.26,1:29:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.99,1:29:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲的书桌\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, on my father's desk.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.23,1:29:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,红皮书\N{\fnArial\fs30}the red book.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.17,1:29:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}His journal.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.00,1:29:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他天天写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wrote in it every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.90,1:29:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在他无法再写\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now he'd never write in it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.51,1:29:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一刻我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}At that moment I knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.07,1:29:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生活会有所不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}my life would never be the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.08,1:29:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跑到外头暴风雨里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I raced out into the storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.02,1:30:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,想摆脱愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to outrun the rage.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.52,1:30:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.32,1:30:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I fell.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.73,1:30:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我始终感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fell forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.36,1:30:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨大的黑洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cave was monstrous.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.63,1:30:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定在那里有上万年\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must have been there for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.14,1:30:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.14,1:30:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,深深的阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}deep in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.38,1:30:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.08,1:30:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西朝我逼近\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was coming toward me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.92,1:30:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始我害怕 只是一开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was scared at first, but only at first.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.32,1:30:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗中的影子是我的注定\N{\fnArial\fs30}The figure in the dark was my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.26,1:30:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个改变我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would change my life forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.70,1:30:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这个与罪犯心中的恐惧相对抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would use its image to strike terror into the hearts of those who did evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.44,1:30:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让这些事情不再在别人身上发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would ensure what happened to me would never happen to anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.97,1:30:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.65,1:30:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想对我说的是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you trying to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.25,1:31:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.22,1:31:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鬼登门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twick or tweet!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.03,1:31:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,诡计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.37,1:31:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.04,1:31:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要活捉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seize and capture.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.51,1:32:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No killing.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.64,1:32:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让你增加力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}That goes double for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.45,1:32:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是超级英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I was a superhero.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.32,1:32:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会躲到哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}where would I hide?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.22,1:32:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,打屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spank me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.57,1:32:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急警报 紧急警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruder alert! Intruder alert! Intruder alert!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.11,1:32:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急警报 紧急警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruder alert! Intruder alert!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.45,1:32:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.46,1:32:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 是留下印记的时候啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's impressive!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.51,1:33:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,把驯服的动物带到旷野里总是有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's always risky introducing a tamed animal into the wild.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.43,1:33:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对适应新环境有困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may have trouble adapting to their new environment.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.17,1:34:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可有人告诉胖姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody tell the fat lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.50,1:34:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只有5岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's on in five.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.59,1:34:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Joygasm！」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joygasm!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.82,1:34:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.70,1:35:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.23,1:35:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果杀掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.71,1:35:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就无法学习事情啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}he won't learn nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.91,1:35:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Bruce!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.19,1:36:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎样 年轻人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you, young man?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.43,1:36:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直不来叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't called me that for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.70,1:36:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,顽固的老习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old habits die hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.40,1:36:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.63,1:36:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,切斯在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Chase?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.07,1:36:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕被抓走啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid they've taken her.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.57,1:36:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克少爷走掉啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Dick has run away.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.31,1:36:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,洞穴被破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cave has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.18,1:36:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有一个谜语\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's another riddle.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.19,1:36:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来啦 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming, my sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.63,1:36:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜不喜欢这件夹克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the jacket?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.36,1:36:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让我很安全的当我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It keeps me safe when I'm.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.53,1:36:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上出去跑步\N{\fnArial\fs30}jogging at night.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.24,1:36:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠会来救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batman will come for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.24,1:36:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batman?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.64,1:37:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说蝙蝠侠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batman, you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.48,1:37:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来救你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.48,1:37:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.32,1:37:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,算到这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}counting on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.79,1:37:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个怎样一回事？从哪里弄来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? Where's it coming from?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.69,1:37:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.96,1:37:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁干的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's doing that?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.03,1:37:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谜语者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Riddler!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.63,1:37:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们是日常所见的5件物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We're five little items of an everyday sort.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.37,1:37:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在网球场找得到「\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find us all in a tennis court."
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.48,1:37:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnArial\fs30}In.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.78,1:37:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,A-E-I-O-U\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-E-I-O-U.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.38,1:37:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,元音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vowels.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.55,1:37:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非不聪明 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not entirely unclever, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.32,1:37:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但跟钟 火柴 棋子有何关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what do a clock, a match, chess pawns.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.15,1:37:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,共有的元音 谜语意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and vowels have in common? What do these riddles mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.72,1:37:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谜语都有一个数字 顺序是：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every riddle contains a number and they arrived in this order:
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.99,1:37:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,13 1 8\N{\fnArial\fs30}13, 1, 8.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.69,1:37:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,和 5\N{\fnArial\fs30}and 5.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.70,1:37:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,13 1 8 和 5\N{\fnArial\fs30}13, 1, 8 and 5.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.60,1:37:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.77,1:37:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,字母表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letters of the alphabet?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.70,1:38:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 13是M\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, 13 is M.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.77,1:38:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,1是A 8是H 还有 5是E\N{\fnArial\fs30}1 would be A, 8 would be H and 5 would be E.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.47,1:38:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,M-A-H-E\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-A-H-E.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.31,1:38:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许1和8是18\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps 1 and 8 are 18.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.65,1:38:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,18是R\N{\fnArial\fs30}18 is "R".
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.15,1:38:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,M-R-E\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-R-E.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.79,1:38:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这个怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.05,1:38:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,「E先生」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Mr. E"?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.72,1:38:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 秘密？- 秘密的另一个说法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mystery? - Another name for mystery?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.99,1:38:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enigma\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enigma.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.49,1:38:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,E Nygma先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. E. Nygma.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.76,1:38:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Edward Nygma\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward Nygma.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.53,1:38:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stickley的自杀是电脑伪造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stickley's suicide was obviously a computer-generated forgery.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.63,1:38:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确实很聪明 不管别人怎样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really are quite bright, despite what people say.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.84,1:38:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠装都被毁掉啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are all the Batsuits destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.11,1:38:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有声纳改装的那个 但未经测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}All except the prototype with the sonar modifications. But it's not tested.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.78,1:38:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight's a good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.46,1:39:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有何建议？海水\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you suggest? By sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.43,1:39:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是通过空气？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or by air?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.90,1:39:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,何不两者兼具？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not both.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.11,1:39:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的裁缝是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's your tailor?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.62,1:39:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,借用你的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took the liberty, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.55,1:39:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,「R？」\N{\fnArial\fs30}R?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.86,1:39:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,代表意思是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that stand for?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.46,1:39:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robin.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.96,1:39:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谜语者和双脸得到一对死亡对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riddler and Two-Face can make a pretty lethal combination.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.90,1:39:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以用一只手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can use a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.77,1:39:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,2对2比较合理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two against two are better odds.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.44,1:39:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会杀掉哈维\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't promise I won't kill Harvey.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.37,1:39:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,「男人要走自己的路」\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man's got to go his own way.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.97,1:39:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个朋友这样对我说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend taught me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.51,1:39:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just a friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.61,1:39:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}A partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.25,1:40:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.52,1:40:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.30,1:40:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute! Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.74,1:40:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 向前冲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.50,1:41:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,A-14\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-14.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.41,1:41:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.25,1:41:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.05,1:41:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,B-12\N{\fnArial\fs30}B-12.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.99,1:41:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.52,1:41:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢维生素\N{\fnArial\fs30}My favorite vitamin.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.10,1:41:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,被淹的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sinking feeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.17,1:41:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like this game.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.57,1:41:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,C-9\N{\fnArial\fs30}C-9!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.58,1:42:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你沉掉我的战舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sunk my battleship!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.42,1:42:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.38,1:42:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的船长说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your captain speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.11,1:42:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到你的座位上 要遭遇紊流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please return to your seats. We will be experiencing turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.99,1:42:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到他啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.23,1:42:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能够找到黑匣子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope they can find the little black box.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.05,1:43:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.25,1:43:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的游戏开始啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}the real game begins.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.06,1:43:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是生锈的金属 蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy rusted metal, Batman!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.86,1:44:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,海底 全是金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ground, it's all metal.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.70,1:44:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是洞穴 洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's full of holes. Holy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.10,1:44:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.54,1:44:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个岛在移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole island's moving!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.66,1:45:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,找我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for us?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.10,1:45:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个为我妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.23,1:45:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.24,1:45:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.60,1:45:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是为我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is for me!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.90,1:45:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终 正义会实现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, justice is served!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.57,1:45:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us die!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.72,1:46:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会继承我的心 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a man after our own heart, son!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.62,1:46:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在地狱见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in hell!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.66,1:46:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更想在监狱见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather see you in jail!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.84,1:46:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好孩子 好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good boy. Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.50,1:46:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠把你调教的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bat's taught you well.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.31,1:46:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noble.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.57,1:46:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.51,1:46:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但尊贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}but noble.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.39,1:47:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riddle me this.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.52,1:47:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riddle me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.39,1:47:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁害怕大黑蝠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's afraid of the big black bat?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.13,1:47:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再耍诡计 爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more tricks, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.23,1:47:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.57,1:47:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来真家伙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get real.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.57,1:47:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,放掉切斯 这是你我之间的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release Chase. This is between us.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.08,1:47:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.31,1:47:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and me!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.75,1:47:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吸取纽约人的脑电波 现在你可以阅读人的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've sucked Gotham's brain waves and now you've devised a way to read minds.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.86,1:47:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betcha!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.39,1:47:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快我的小盒子会遍布整个世界的电视机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon my little Box will be on countless TV's around the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.30,1:47:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我带来信用卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}feeding me credit card numbers.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.03,1:47:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,银行帐号\N{\fnArial\fs30}bank codes.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.90,1:48:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,性幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}sexual fantasies.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.84,1:48:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,和小小的白色谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}and little white lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.57,1:48:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会走进我的头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into my head they'll go.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.97,1:48:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功是可以想见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victory is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:08.74,1:48:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为知识的力量是无穷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For if knowledge is power.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.91,1:48:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}then a god.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.75,1:48:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}am.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.85,1:48:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.59,1:48:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是否就是最高理想？我现在还不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that over the top? I can never tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.80,1:48:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便告诉你 我还要看看你的思想 畸形怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, I've seen your mind. Freak!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.43,1:48:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最大的谜语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours is the greatest riddle of all!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.50,1:48:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯威恩跟蝙蝠侠是否能共存？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can Bruce Wayne and Batman ever truly coexist?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.97,1:48:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天将要揭晓\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find out today!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.91,1:48:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先 请出不同意见者\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, let's meet our contestants.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.71,1:48:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,帘布之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind curtain.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.32,1:48:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}number one.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.22,1:48:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,才华惊人的切斯 玛瑞迪安博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}the absolutely fabulous Dr. Chase Meridian!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.66,1:49:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她喜欢徒步旅行 修剪指甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She enjoys hiking, manicures.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.36,1:49:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,痴痴的想成为布鲁斯生活中的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and foolishly hopes to be the love of Bruce's life.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.90,1:49:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number two:
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.04,1:49:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,肥蝙蝠的一个也是唯一一个搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fatman's one and only partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.81,1:49:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个杂耍戏子和孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This acrobat turned orphan.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.91,1:49:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢星期六早上的动画片 幻想有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}likes Saturday morning cartoons and dreams of one day being.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.72,1:49:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟一个女孩赤身裸体在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}bare-naked with a girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.52,1:49:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这些不同意见者的下头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And below these contestants.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.93,1:49:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的一点个人爱好：\N{\fnArial\fs30}my personal favorite:
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.20,1:49:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,水的地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}A watery grave.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.43,1:49:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻轻的一按\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one little touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.57,1:49:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,五秒钟以后2个参加者就要\N{\fnArial\fs30}and five seconds later these two players are.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.97,1:49:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,葬身在岩石上\N{\fnArial\fs30}gull feed on the rocks below.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.98,1:49:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够时间两个一起救\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not enough time to save them both.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.12,1:49:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠 你救哪个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one will it be, Batman?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.59,1:49:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯的爱人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce's love?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.22,1:50:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是黑夜武士的小搭档？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the Dark Knight's junior partner?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.79,1:50:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不出办法如何救他和我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no way for me to save them or myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.56,1:50:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个巨大的死亡陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all one giant death-trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.33,1:50:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judges?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.77,1:50:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你的回答必须用提问的形式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Your answer must be in the form of a question.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.64,1:50:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过谢谢你的参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}But thanks for playing.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.44,1:50:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.84,1:50:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个给你的题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a riddle.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.34,1:50:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.35,1:50:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.78,1:50:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.79,1:50:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不用看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see without seeing.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.19,1:50:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我而言 黑夜跟白天一样清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me, darkness is as clear as daylight.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.83,1:50:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.40,1:50:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.33,1:50:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个瞎蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're as blind as a bat!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.24,1:50:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.41,1:51:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bummer!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.17,1:52:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.42,1:52:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些大话都毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those heroics for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.42,1:52:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再出题 不再有帘子和第一第二\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more riddles, no more curtains one and two.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.46,1:52:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有彻底的结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just plain curtains!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.30,1:52:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘记一件事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you forgetting something?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.53,1:53:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your coin.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.57,1:53:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是有两颗心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're always of two minds.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.77,1:53:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 当然 你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.41,1:53:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,感情是正确判断之敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emotion's always the enemy of justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.08,1:53:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是一个好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've always been a good friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.93,1:54:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.23,1:54:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't I.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.76,1:54:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀掉你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill you?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.70,1:54:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.04,1:54:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.47,1:54:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.48,1:54:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须救两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to save them both.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.98,1:54:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我既是布鲁斯又是蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I'm both Bruce Wayne and Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.48,1:54:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是因为不得不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not because I have to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.55,1:54:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.25,1:54:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I choose to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.78,1:54:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你前来帮助我会诊 玛瑞迪安博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for responding to my request for a consultation, Dr. Meridian.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.42,1:54:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward Nygma.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.82,1:55:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,连续几个小时尖叫说他知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been screaming for hours that he knows the true identity.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.75,1:55:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠的真实身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.07,1:55:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.07,1:55:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.77,1:55:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.91,1:55:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是切斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Dr. Meridian. Chase.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.61,1:55:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可记得我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.19,1:55:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎能忘记？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I forget?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.69,1:55:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯顿博士告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Burton tells me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.76,1:55:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道蝙蝠侠是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know who Batman is.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.73,1:55:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你只要你不对我说「请」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you if you don't say, "please."
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.13,1:55:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华 请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.93,1:55:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是蝙蝠侠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is Batman?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.24,1:55:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.81,1:55:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蝙蝠侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.47,1:56:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密安全啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your secret is safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.47,1:56:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他完全精神失常\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is definitely a wacko.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.81,1:56:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,「精神失常？」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wacko.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.14,1:56:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个专业说法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a technical term?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.58,1:56:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.25,1:56:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't need this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.89,1:56:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你给我新的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for giving me a new dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.47,1:57:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要工作太晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't work too late.
